# Enterprise domain CODEOWNERS model.
#
# Both verified repository collaborators are assigned to each protected
# domain so that a pull request opened by either account can be reviewed
# by the other without relying on self-approval.
#
# This is an incremental ownership control. It does not by itself close
# ERM-OWN-001, ERM-CTRL-008 or ERM-CTRL-009. Closure still requires
# effective code-owner review enforcement and representative path canaries.

